    "message": "Move the Cloud Operator skills to organization-scoped operator agents.\n\nEach user now has one personal operator agent per Google Cloud organization.\nThe cloud-operator, cloud-operator-setup and cloud-operator-share-context\nskills find the organization of the project the user works in, call the\noperator with `organization`, and walk the user through creating their agent\nwhen they don't have one yet.\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 1025598336",
